Subject: [PATCH] add-support-makefile-scripts

---
 Makefile                       |  41 +++++++--
 scripts/ant.its                | 158 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 scripts/ant.mk                 |  10 +++
 scripts/create_fsbl_project.py |  92 +++++++++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 292 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 scripts/ant.its
